    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "He is really troubled watching what's happening. And I think you can imagine for somebody who obviously served at the highest levels of government. And I think Whether you agree or disagree with policies, I think you would have to look, for example, at President Bush 41's national security team and look at the combination of my dad and Brent Scowcroft and Jim Baker and just recognize the seriousness. And I do think that there There is a level of understanding of the responsibility that comes with these offices and the seriousness of the challenges we face as a country. And so, you know, he is deeply concerned about what's happened to our party and what's happening in the country. And I talk to him about it a lot. He's great to be able to bounce ideas off of and get historic perspective from. as is my mom as",
