    "turn_idx": 40,
    "turn_text": "Now I think so they do but I also like my kids I'm very proud of them and you know they each sort of handle politics and they have different levels of interest in politics. Uh, one of my daughters, I won't say which one, but she was, she was someplace over the course of the last year and a half where somebody said something to her very sort of critical or mean about me. And I, I said to my daughter, well, how did you respond when this person said this thing to you? And as he said, mom, I told her that she was both stupid and rude. Okay.",
