      },
      {
        "text": "Impeachment was delayed because sufficient evidentiary support was lacking at the time.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There were subpoenas issued but not enforced during the initial phase of the investigation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Evidence based on subpoena enforcement carries greater weight than other forms of evidence.",
