    "turn_idx": 94,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and I think it is. It's that combination of people who are in a position to certify the next election and who have said already that they would ignore what happened in the last election. They wouldn't have certified it in the face of the law and the facts and the results and the recounts and the audits. Carrie Lake and Mark Fincham said they would not have certified. And when you have somebody who has made clear that they won't do their duty, they won't certify if they disagree with the results, you know, you can't put them in power. and I think that-",
