        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "It is morally unacceptable to place someone in power who has openly committed to violating constitutional duties.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The credibility of the democratic process is undermined when officials signal they will act outside the rule of law.",
