    "turn_text": "Yes, there's no doubt. One of the reasons that 72% believe this is because in the outlets where they get their information or what's purported to be information, they're being told that this is the case. But I can only imagine your colleagues. who you're calling out here saying, yeah, well, guess what? I'm going back to Congress and you're not Liz Cheney. So, you know, you can tell me whatever you want, but I'm going to be here and I want to be here. Kinsinger said when he was here, you know, there are people for whom being in Congress is not just a job, but it's their identity. And they just can't, they can't imagine not having that. And Donald Trump had the ability to keep them from coming back as he has almost everyone who voted against as either retired or have lost. You've got two who are still standing. One, you know, they still have to win elections in November. So, you know, his message was clear, which is you mess with me. I'm going to end your political career. You're not a great role model in that regard.",
