    "turn_text": "I think the American people deserve to know how Steve Bannon knew January 6 was going to happen before it happened. And I think that they deserve to know the facts from him. And I think that there's a reason why he would not appear in front of our committee. And the law is very clear. But I think the American people deserve to understand and know the role that he played in all of this.",
